WrapperToken::setRollOverBot
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── given caller is owner
    ├── when rollOverBot is zero address
    │   └── it should revert with ZeroAddress
    └── when rollOverBot is valid
        ├── it should update rollOverBot
        └── it should emit RollOverBotSet
